age-encryption.js — the age file encryption library by the age authors (typage), for the
Backup tab's restore: the owner's browser opens a backup's sealed key file with their
Host recovery key and seals it again to this Host, so the recovery key never leaves the
browser (system-apps/settings/restore.js). No CDN, no custom crypto: this is age's own
JavaScript implementation, bundled into one ES module with its dependencies.

